  "totalBlocks": 24,
  "translatedBlocks": 22,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07c17b7ba4cc7027",
      "translationZh": "在与基准测试基础设施折腾了两天之后，我终于在 16GB 显存上对 IFM/K2-Horizon-7B 做了基准测试。简而言之：能用，但远远落后于 Qwen-3.8-27B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a131211815c082e4",
      "translationZh": "我在以下配置下比较了 3 个模型——Qwen3.8-27B、Ornith-1.5-9B 和新推出的 IFM/K2-Horizon-7B：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4917c6b9768a1a11",
      "translationZh": "所有模型都完全装入了 16GB 显存（AMD RX7600XT 16GB，RDNA3），未使用 CPU 卸载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b1a0037b66600d1",
      "translationZh": "Ornith-1.5-9B 和 K2-Horizon-7B 的权重量化格式为 Q8_0，Qwen3.8-27B 则为 GSQ-RCO-IQ3_XXS。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1fb334e0f0fb70ac",
      "translationZh": "KV 量化格式根据 100k+ 上下文长度下的可用显存来选择（在我看来，这是智能体编程最低可用的上下文长度）：Ornith-1.5-9B 使用 f16，K2-Horizon-7B 和 Qwen3.8-27B 使用 Q4_0。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "45c2e0dca2d56443",
      "translationZh": "推理使用了 llama.cpp 的 HIP ROCm 构建版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e3ca6df7b2ef979",
      "translationZh": "Ornith-1.5-9B 和 Qwen3.8-27B 使用主线版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "02d3423effe1f6ca",
      "translationZh": "K2-Horizon-7B 使用 MBZUAI-IFM/llama.cpp 分支版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cc7800a44b48b93a",
      "translationZh": "LLM 服务器运行在 Ubuntu-24.04.4 上，使用 AMD 官方驱动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "357f05ff40c6e805",
      "translationZh": "基准测试使用 MicroBench-12，在 WSL 下运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4d0e6bf6beb4d624",
      "translationZh": "基准测试框架：干净的 pi.dev，搭配 pi-sandbox 插件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "074c15aa9437be5f",
      "translationZh": "完成时限：每项任务 40 分钟",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18bc6a1d62927b75",
      "translationZh": "排名 模型及量化 上下文及 KV 量化 已完成 已完成任务的正确性 实际耗时（秒）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a50bdcac4234323",
      "translationZh": "K2-Horizon-7B 的结果受到部分污染——在分析最终结果时，我发现该模型找到了并查看了其他模型（Qwen 和 Ornith）的运行结果。我决定不重新运行基准测试，因为即使有了这些信息，它也未能取得好成绩。其他模型的运行没有受到污染。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "134bb795a6a05613",
      "translationZh": "K2-Horizon-7B 思考的时间非常长，4 项失败任务中有 3 项是因为超时（尽管每项任务给了非常宽裕的 40 分钟），还有 1 项任务虽然完成了，但代码有问题，无法验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "58d17c1c16192b89",
      "translationZh": "我知道 Q4_0 KV 不好（我为什么选它，见上文），但 Qwen 即使使用这种量化也能正常工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4626839c012c6e89",
      "translationZh": "即使在速度较慢、位宽为 128-bit 的 16GB RX7600XT 上，Qwen3.8-27B 也是最强的、无可争议的王者——即使采用 IQ3_XSS 量化和 Q4_0 KV-cache，它也轻松解决了所有任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "347d8f6554dacff2",
      "translationZh": "Ornith-1.5-9B 得分第二。不过，它的速度是前者的 2 倍，完全可以用于智能体编程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cf1a2a953816f4f1",
      "translationZh": "遗憾的是，新的 K2-Horizon-7B 排在最后。也许使用量化程度更低的 KV-cache 会表现得更好，但 16GB VRAM 没有足够的空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aae49bb32b247aca",
      "translationZh": "所以，毫不意外，Qwen 王者万岁！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2942cff5d041f76d",
      "translationZh": "应 u/kevinlch 的请求，我也对 Qwen3.5-9B Q8_0 运行了基准测试（unsloth/Qwen3.5-9B-MTP-GGUF）。它的成绩几乎接近 Ornith-1.5-9B，略低一些，但速度更快：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efa06c956da9dfa0",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Barni275 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
